{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EX0mGSkJiN1792683568.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股三大指數早段全線急跌，科技股普遍受壓。</p><p></p><p>中東局勢緊張，國際油價急升，不利投資氣氛。道指曾跌逾300點，跌至52,500點邊緣。納指早段急挫至逾600點，跌幅逾百分之2，跌至26,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>科技股普遍受壓，Facebook母公司Meta計劃增加資本開支，信用風險指標升至新高，股價急挫逾百分之6。戴爾電腦和英特爾跌百分之4至5。</p><p></p><p>晶片股輝達、閃迪和美光科技，曾跌約百分之4至5。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:37.103330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T17:18:11.020597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:56.514872+00:00","content_hash":"6f4233ad3c87079be1d67910a735f2987a089cff6b26c72f64a1d53d8ef64b1d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:37.103330+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}